# vim: ft=mbsyncrc

### LOGALTY
IMAPAccount logalty
Host outlook.office365.com
User miguel.lopez@logalty.com
PassCmd "pass mail/logalty"
SSLType IMAPS
SSLVersions TLSv1.2
AuthMechs LOGIN
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore logalty-remote
Account logalty 

MaildirStore logalty-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.local/share/mail/logalty/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/logalty/Inbox

Channel logalty 
Far :logalty-remote:
Near :logalty-local:
Create Both
Expunge Both
Patterns "INBOX" "Archivo"
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes

